    },
    "视频站点" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Videoseiten" } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Video Sites" } },
        "fr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Sites vidéo" } },
        "ko" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "동영상 사이트" } }
      }
    },
    "关闭后，对应网站的页面将无法解析，「解析视频」按钮也会置灰。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Nach dem Deaktivieren können Seiten der Website nicht mehr analysiert werden; die Schaltfläche „Video analysieren“ ist dann ausgegraut." } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "When off, pages from this site can't be parsed and the Parse Video button stays disabled." } },
        "fr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Une fois désactivé, les pages de ce site ne peuvent plus être analysées et le bouton « Analyser la vidéo » reste grisé." } },
        "ko" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "끄면 해당 사이트의 페이지를 분석할 수 없고 '동영상 분석' 버튼도 비활성화됩니다." } }
      }
    },
    "实验性功能" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Experimentell" } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Experimental" } },
        "fr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Expérimental" } },
        "ko" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "실험적 기능" } }
      }
    },
    "多线程下载" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Mehrthread-Download" } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Multi-threaded Download" } },
        "fr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Téléchargement multithread" } },
        "ko" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "멀티스레드 다운로드" } }
      }
    },
    "下载线程数" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Anzahl Threads" } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Download Threads" } },
        "fr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Nombre de threads" } },
        "ko" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "다운로드 스레드 수" } }
      }
    },
    "把文件分成多个分片并行下载，可能提升速度。部分站点会限速或拒绝多连接，若出现下载失败请关闭此项。已开始的任务需要重试后才会按新设置重新分片。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Die Datei wird zum parallelen Download in mehrere Teile zerlegt, was schneller sein kann. Manche Server begrenzen oder verweigern mehrere Verbindungen; schalte dies bei Fehlern ab. Laufende Aufgaben werden erst nach einem erneuten Versuch neu aufgeteilt." } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Splits the file into multiple parts downloaded in parallel, which may be faster. Some servers rate-limit or refuse multiple connections; turn this off if downloads fail. Running tasks are re-segmented only after a retry." } },
        "fr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Divise le fichier en plusieurs parties téléchargées en parallèle, ce qui peut être plus rapide. Certains serveurs limitent ou refusent les connexions multiples ; désactivez cette option en cas d'échec. Les tâches en cours ne sont re-segmentées qu'après un nouvel essai." } },
        "ko" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "파일을 여러 조각으로 나누어 병렬로 다운로드합니다. 속도가 빨라질 수 있지만, 일부 서버는 다중 연결을 제한하거나 거부하므로 실패 시 끄세요. 진행 중인 작업은 재시도해야 새 설정으로 다시 분할됩니다." } }
      }
    },
    "语言" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Sprache" } },
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Language" } },
        "fr" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Langue" } },
        "ko" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "언어" } }
